@startuml multi-agent-system
!theme plain
title Multi-Agent System - Review Analysis Flow

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #E6F2FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #0066CC

|Review Input|
start
:Receive Review;
:Cleanse Content;

|#E6FFE6|Sentiment Agent|
:Analyze Sentiment;
note right
  - 5-level classification
  - Emotion detection
  - Confidence scoring
  - Reasoning storage
end note
:Return SentimentResult;

|#FFE6E6|Category Agent|
:Classify Category;
note right
  - Primary category
  - Secondary categories
  - Feature/Service/Performance metrics
  - Related screens
end note
:Return CategoryResult;

|#FFF2E6|Complaint Agent|
if (is_negative?) then (yes)
  :Classify Complaint Type;
  :Assign Department;
  :Calculate Urgency/Severity;
  :Determine Escalation;
  note right
    Departments:
    - IT_APP
    - IT_INFRA
    - IT_SEC
    - CS_CENTER
    - BIZ_CARD
    - BIZ_LOAN
    - COMPLIANCE
    - LEGAL
    - UX_DESIGN
    - MARKETING
  end note
  :Return ComplaintResult;
else (no)
  :Mark as non-complaint;
endif

|#E6E6FF|Embedding Service|
:Generate Embedding Vector;
note right
  Primary: Gemini API
  Fallback: Local Model
  Tertiary: BM25 Keywords
end note

|Storage|
:Store to OpenSearch;
note right
  - Original content
  - Cleansed content
  - Embedding vector (768 dims)
  - Analysis results
  - LLM reasoning (for prompt improvement)
end note

stop

@enduml
